DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The ALH is in Calamba.

2089
02:01:58,390 --> 02:02:00,670
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The SWD is not there also.

2090
02:02:00,670 --> 02:02:06,830
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, what we propose is that we break up region, we bring it back to Region 4 into one region,

2091
02:02:07,350 --> 02:02:10,750
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: but divide it into different command centers.

2092
02:02:11,290 --> 02:02:17,030
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: What we would propose is that Cavite and Palawan be one region, one sub-region,

2093
02:02:17,690 --> 02:02:21,790
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Batangas and Mindoro, one region, Laguna and Rizal, one region,

2094
02:02:22,270 --> 02:02:26,190
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and then Quezon and Marinduque and Rumblon.

2095
02:02:26,210 --> 02:02:28,210
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: They will all be one region.

2096
02:02:28,210 --> 02:02:36,770
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In that way, Sir, the government functions will be more rationalized.

2097
02:02:36,770 --> 02:02:45,970
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: As of now, Sir, it's almost impossible to be command or to be regional director of any agency to be in 4B.

2098
02:02:45,970 --> 02:02:50,770
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And no one is in Calapan, except for the PNP.

2099
02:02:50,770 --> 02:02:55,470
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But outside that, even agriculture, you were once part of the SWD, they're here in Manila.

2100
02:02:55,470 --> 02:02:56,330
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Everyone is in Manila.

2101
02:02:56,610 --> 02:03:00,550
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So I suggest that we break up that region to make it more responsive to the times.

2102
02:03:01,070 --> 02:03:02,850
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So when do you plan to do that?

2103
02:03:03,430 --> 02:03:09,490
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We will propose it to the Senate this coming, this year, Sir, and hopefully it will be supported.

2104
02:03:10,330 --> 02:03:10,810
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you, Po.

2105
02:03:11,630 --> 02:03:18,950
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Another thing, Sec, yung ating pong PNP Maritime, kailangan po nila ng mga fast craft, lalo po sa Palawan,

2106
02:03:18,950 --> 02:03:23,130
Senator Erwin Tulfo: because I came from Palawan, panghabol po sa mga illegal fishermen.

2107
02:03:24,050 --> 02:03:25,030
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Medyo nahihirapan po sila.

2108
02:03:25,470 --> 02:03:31,770
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ilang po mga members, yung sasakyan po ng maritime, minsan hindi na po gumagana, problema po, pyesa.

2109
02:03:31,830 --> 02:03:35,230
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung iba naman, gumagawa ng paraan, sumasakay po sa pump boat.

2110
02:03:35,650 --> 02:03:40,930
Senator Erwin Tulfo: E hindi sila makahabol po sa mga illegal fishermen, mga basnig, mga twin engine pa.

2111
02:03:41,350 --> 02:03:43,070
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So what do you plan to do this?

2112
02:03:43,070 --> 02:03:52,830
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Are you going to procure more sea transport for our faster vehicle or sea vessel for our PNP Maritime?

2113
02:03:53,550 --> 02:03:54,470
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: No, Sir.

2114
02:03:55,470 --> 02:03:59,950
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Our strategy is the rationalization of the Philippine Coast Guard at the maritime.

2115
02:04:00,870 --> 02:04:07,350
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We believe that the Philippine Coast Guard, which is currently under the DOTR, should be under the DILG.

2116
02:04:08,050 --> 02:04:13,290
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If the Coast Guard is under the DILG, because they are in charge of law enforcement in the seas,

2117
02:04:13,290 --> 02:04:25,290
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: then we can abrogate the entire maritime command of the PNP and have the Coast Guard be in charge of enforcement.

2118
02:04:25,470 --> 02:04:32,790
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We would also like to suggest that the BGNP be transferred to the Bureau of Corrections

2119
02:04:32,790 --> 02:04:36,430
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: so that we will only have one correctional institution instead of two.

2120
02:04:37,370 --> 02:04:39,050
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It's very confusing now, Sir.

2121
02:04:40,190 --> 02:04:43,570
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ibang BGNP, ibang BUCOR, dapat isa na lang yan, Sir.

2122
02:04:44,510 --> 02:04:46,350
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So yung karpeta nila magkaiba.

2123
02:04:46,970 --> 02:04:53,190
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So those are the things that we think we should do to rationalize the system of law enforcement in the country.

2124
02:04:53,950 --> 02:04:55,370
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I have filed.

2125
02:04:55,470 --> 02:05:04,890
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Already a bill on that matter, Sir, this year to transfer the BGNP to the Bureau of Corrections.

2126
02:05:05,070 --> 02:05:05,210
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, Sir.

2127
02:05:05,630 --> 02:05:11,830
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It would also help, Sir, if the Philippine Coast Guard were transferred to the DILG

2128
02:05:11,830 --> 02:05:15,230
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: so that the law enforcement would all be under one department.

2129
02:05:15,890 --> 02:05:25,130
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, another aspect, Sir, is that we are the only country in the ASEAN that the Bureau of Immigration is under the Department of Justice.

2130
02:05:25,270 --> 02:05:25,450
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Enough.

2131
02:05:25,470 --> 02:05:27,310
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Not under the Department of the Interior.

2132
02:05:27,970 --> 02:05:35,650
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: As of now, Sir, when we go after foreign nationals, we have to go to the, the process is very cumbersome.

2133
02:05:35,830 --> 02:05:40,190
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We have to go to the Bureau of Immigration, who has to go to the Department of Justice,

2134
02:05:40,870 --> 02:05:45,950
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: who will then give authorization to the Bureau of Immigration, who will then go back to the PNP.

2135
02:05:46,390 --> 02:05:51,710
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So our response time for fugitives or for foreigners is more difficult.

2136
02:05:51,710 --> 02:05:54,330
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So those are the rationalizations we propose, Sir.

2137
02:05:54,850 --> 02:05:55,350
Senator Panfilo Lacson: With your permission.

2138
02:05:55,470 --> 02:05:56,510
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you, Senator Tulfo.

2139
02:05:57,370 --> 02:05:59,090
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Have you recommended to the President?

2140
02:05:59,510 --> 02:06:00,290
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, Sir.

2141
02:06:00,510 --> 02:06:02,130
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And he has expressed support.

2142
02:06:02,290 --> 02:06:08,210
Senator Panfilo Lacson: We have lawyers here, and I believe it will only take an EO under the administrative code.

2143
02:06:08,590 --> 02:06:09,010
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yes, Sir.

2144
02:06:09,050 --> 02:06:10,570
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hindi kailangan ng legislation.

2145
02:06:11,050 --> 02:06:16,270
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So if the President is, you know, is in agreement with the proposal,

2146
02:06:16,450 --> 02:06:23,070
Senator Panfilo Lacson: maybe you can just drop an EO for the President and the BGNP may be transferred to...

2147
02:06:23,070 --> 02:06:23,370
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, Sir.

2148
02:06:23,670 --> 02:06:25,450
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We have done so.

2149
02:06:25,470 --> 02:06:25,750
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you, Sir.

2150
02:06:25,990 --> 02:06:26,290
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you.

2151
02:06:28,030 --> 02:06:31,510
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hopefully, he said he will act on it already, so hopefully it will be done soon.

2152
02:06:31,790 --> 02:06:32,130
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you.

2153
02:06:33,330 --> 02:06:35,750
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'm Mr. Chairman with the indulgence of Senator Tulfo.

2154
02:06:35,850 --> 02:06:42,230
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With regards to the maritime, sa PNP Maritime, we have equipped the PNP Maritime recently, no?

2155
02:06:43,670 --> 02:06:46,610
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With new vessels, no?

2156
02:06:46,670 --> 02:06:49,690
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung pong mga rib, yung mga rigid hull inflatable boats.

2157
02:06:50,330 --> 02:06:54,810
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi po dati, yung pong concern nyo na dati pag meron kinindap o hinahabol,

2158
02:06:54,810 --> 02:07:01,230
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: titignan lang sila Abu Sef, hindi sila makahabol kasi twin engine yung sa mga bandido.

2159
02:07:01,550 --> 02:07:04,250
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tapos yung sa atin, mabagal, hindi pa makagitna.

2160
02:07:04,790 --> 02:07:10,030
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But recently, we were able to equip the maritime with new vessels.

2161
02:07:10,190 --> 02:07:15,870
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang problema lang yung ano nito, yung the challenge is the DMOE, yung maintenance sila, no?

2162
02:07:15,930 --> 02:07:17,090
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi medyo mahal lang, ano eh.

2163
02:07:17,710 --> 02:07:23,830
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Lalo yung fuel, lalo yung mga triple, ano to, di ba, tatlong engines nung minsan, yung ribs natin, yung mga rib boats.

2164
02:07:23,830 --> 02:07:24,730
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, yun lang.

2165
02:07:24,810 --> 02:07:26,570
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And Mr. Chair, just to interject.

2166
02:07:27,090 --> 02:07:27,530
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you.

2167
02:07:27,970 --> 02:07:30,730
Senator Erwin Tulfo: One last question po, Secretary John Vic.

2168
02:07:31,330 --> 02:07:37,130
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ilalapit ko na rin po sa inyo, tutal eh, mahilig po kayong baguhin at ayusin po yung sistema.

2169
02:07:38,030 --> 02:07:39,610
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kaya nga po, eh, natutuwa ako.

2170
02:07:40,290 --> 02:07:41,750
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ilalapit ko lang po sa inyo ito.

2171
02:07:41,830 --> 02:07:44,010
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I don't know kung nakarating na po sa inyong kalaman.

2172
02:07:44,730 --> 02:07:52,190
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ito pong problema ng 911 emergency service na 2.45% lang po ang obligation rate.

2173
02:07:52,550 --> 02:07:53,510
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Napakababa nga po.

2174
02:07:54,810 --> 02:07:58,110
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero ang problema po kasi parang matagal pong sumagot.

2175
02:07:58,290 --> 02:08:02,610
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Meron hong isang nagpadala po sa amin, si Basti Ascripa ito sa Facebook.

2176
02:08:03,330 --> 02:08:04,110
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pinoast niya.

2177
02:08:04,730 --> 02:08:07,070
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Actually, nag-viral po ito, 1.7 million.

2178
02:08:07,170 --> 02:08:11,750
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Namatay daw yung tatay niya kasi tunghawin sa 911, 10 minutes bago sumagot po.

2179
02:08:12,130 --> 02:08:14,530
Senator Erwin Tulfo: At nung sumag pa, hinold po po siya.

2180
02:08:14,890 --> 02:08:16,710
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Can you look into this, Sec?

2181
02:08:16,770 --> 02:08:22,290
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I know you have the, may political will ho kayo at kaya niyong baguhin ito mga,

2182
02:08:22,290 --> 02:08:24,730
Senator Erwin Tulfo: at risolbahin naman kayo itong klaseng problema.

2183
02:08:24,810 --> 02:08:27,410
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, I have the report here on hand.

2184
02:08:27,730 --> 02:08:29,950
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I can submit it or I can read it.

2185
02:08:30,390 --> 02:08:34,130
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, the call was answered at approximately 12.15pm.

2186
02:08:34,830 --> 02:08:38,290
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That was a waiting time of 1 minute and 25 seconds.

2187
02:08:38,930 --> 02:08:42,650
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The biggest problem that we had there, sir, was that he gave a,

2188
02:08:43,390 --> 02:08:48,870
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the address that he gave was a block number and street number and house number.

2189
02:08:48,870 --> 02:08:54,110
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Where in Taguig, red has names of streets.

2190
02:08:54,810 --> 02:08:59,510
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, when we called the Taguig to, Taguig police or BFP to respond,

2191
02:08:59,950 --> 02:09:03,670
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: they couldn't find the address because there is no longer an address,

2192
02:09:03,890 --> 02:09:06,890
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: a record of where that block and street number was.

2193
02:09:07,490 --> 02:09:12,170
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Eventually, they found it, but the barangay had reported ahead.

2194
02:09:12,770 --> 02:09:17,330
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, there was a communication gap and we have addressed that

2195
02:09:17,330 --> 02:09:19,770
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and we are strengthening our response time.

2196
02:09:19,770 --> 02:09:22,070
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But that was a fluke, sir.

2197
02:09:22,190 --> 02:09:24,770
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That was one call that was...

2198
02:09:24,810 --> 02:09:27,970
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that we have learned from and we are improving with.

2199
02:09:28,990 --> 02:09:29,710
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you, po.

2200
02:09:30,110 --> 02:09:31,410
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Last two questions, sir, sir.

2201
02:09:31,950 --> 02:09:38,670
Senator Erwin Tulfo: May plano po ba ang PNP na mag-augment pa po ng air assets para mas mabilis?

2202
02:09:39,110 --> 02:09:43,130
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Given the situation, lalo na po sa Metro Manila na sobrang traffic,

2203
02:09:43,590 --> 02:09:46,990
Senator Erwin Tulfo: mas mabilis po ang mobility kung meron pong air assets

2204
02:09:46,990 --> 02:09:49,750
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ang Philippine National Police to respond, sir?

2205
02:09:50,190 --> 02:09:50,630
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

2206
02:09:50,730 --> 02:09:53,990
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We already started the procurement of high, high...

2207
02:09:54,810 --> 02:09:57,350
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: quality drones instead of helicopters.

2208
02:09:58,070 --> 02:10:06,630
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, the operating cost of helicopters are at almost 80 to 100,000 pesos per hour of use.

2209
02:10:07,330 --> 02:10:10,430
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The drones that we are purchasing, sir, can fly for 7 hours

2210
02:10:10,430 --> 02:10:13,450
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: at only a cost of 5,000 pesos per hour of use.

2211
02:10:13,450 --> 02:10:19,510
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, we are procuring, I think, 10 drones to patrol the entire country.

2212
02:10:20,110 --> 02:10:24,510
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And I think it will be equipped with the latest infrared cameras,

2213
02:10:24,810 --> 02:10:29,770
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and telescopes that can locate and help and augment in the peacekeeping.

2214
02:10:29,950 --> 02:10:34,890
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, if we call 911, we have an air asset on the sky,

2215
02:10:35,210 --> 02:10:38,830
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and it can go immediately on top of the crime scene and give a report on what is going on.

2216
02:10:39,330 --> 02:10:40,070
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you, Secretary.

2217
02:10:40,070 --> 02:10:46,610
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Secretary, please continue po yung ginagawa ninyo mga changes sa inyo pong departamento and attach agency.

2218
02:10:46,790 --> 02:10:48,470
Senator Erwin Tulfo: You are doing a good job. Thank you, Secretary.

2219
02:10:48,470 --> 02:10:49,130
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you very much, sir.

2220
02:10:49,130 --> 02:10:49,650
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

2221
02:10:50,210 --> 02:10:51,270
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you, Senator Tulfo.

2222
02:10:52,650 --> 02:10:54,690
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, with regards to that, sir, we will support you.

2223
02:10:54,810 --> 02:11:00,850
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung acquisition of drones, that's more practical for surveillance and monitoring.

2224
02:11:01,710 --> 02:11:06,650
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But I think yung pong sa, Mr. Chair, yung pong sa, with the use of the helicopters,

2225
02:11:06,790 --> 02:11:10,730
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I think, suggestion nyo natin is to disperse it to the different regions

2226
02:11:10,730 --> 02:11:14,470
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: so that yung presence will be there.

2227
02:11:15,230 --> 02:11:19,750
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi there, I still feel, think that there are still functions,

2228
02:11:19,750 --> 02:11:22,970
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that the helicopter,

2229
02:11:24,810 --> 02:11:26,510
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: so like medical evacuation,

2230
02:11:28,310 --> 02:11:30,050
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: search and rescue,

2231
02:11:30,470 --> 02:11:32,990
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: tsaka pag-rescue mismo, lalo na calamity prone.

2232
02:11:33,610 --> 02:11:40,130
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So we have allocated budget for construction of hangars in Cebu, Davao,

2233
02:11:40,130 --> 02:11:42,050
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and then probably, and also La Union,

2234
02:11:42,310 --> 02:11:45,350
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and probably you can add more so that ma-deploy na sila.

2235
02:11:45,450 --> 02:11:50,290
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi tama naman yung concern na pag nandito na sa Manila yung choppers,

2236
02:11:50,410 --> 02:11:51,870
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: it's just being used for VIP.

2237
02:11:52,090 --> 02:11:54,550
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So I think it will be used for police.

2238
02:11:54,810 --> 02:11:56,110
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ano na talaga functions?

2239
02:11:56,250 --> 02:11:56,550
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

2240
02:11:56,910 --> 02:12:04,210
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I also recommend a change of model, sir, from the Airbus to the MC-10, I think, or MC-11,

2241
02:12:04,390 --> 02:12:07,330
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the model, because as of current,

2242
02:12:07,590 --> 02:12:11,270
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the ones that we have are personal transport vehicles.

2243
02:12:11,510 --> 02:12:13,730
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We cannot convert it for medical evacuation.

2244
02:12:14,470 --> 02:12:16,790
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So we have to change the model of the helicopter, sir,

2245
02:12:16,790 --> 02:12:21,270
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and we will distribute it around the country if we were given the budget to do so.

2246
02:12:21,510 --> 02:12:24,110
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And I agree with Senator J.V. Sec.

2247
02:12:24,200 --> 02:12:26,100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Lalo na sa amin

2248
02:12:26,100 --> 02:12:28,000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: doon sa Palawan, yung marami pong

2249
02:12:28,000 --> 02:12:32,100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: nagkakaingin, yung mga ika nga namumutol po.

2250
02:12:32,600 --> 02:12:34,300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nakikita mo from sa below,

2251
02:12:34,300 --> 02:12:38,500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: sa baba, pero hindi naman po maakyat ng forest rangers natin.

2252
02:12:38,600 --> 02:12:42,500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So ang ginagawa po, pupuntahan, two days na lakaran.

2253
02:12:42,600 --> 02:12:47,800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Whereas kung meron nga po, lalapit po sila sa PNP, tatawag, mas mabilis po yung deployment.

2254
02:12:47,800 --> 02:12:49,000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nakikita agad.

2255
02:12:49,000 --> 02:12:52,500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Unfortunately, hindi po mga ordinary farmers po yung nagkakaingin.

2256
02:12:52,500 --> 02:12:53,500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung mga malalaking

2257
02:12:53,500 --> 02:12:54,800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: mga negosyo doon po

2258
02:12:54,810 --> 02:12:58,890
Senator Erwin Tulfo: doon po nagpuputol ng kahoy, doon po nagsusunog kasi yan din po.

2259
02:12:58,970 --> 02:13:03,830
Senator Erwin Tulfo: At saka itong pagpatrol po sa Sierra Madre, that's also another problem, yung mga illegal logging.

2260
02:13:03,830 --> 02:13:14,810
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes sir, but the helicopters that we have now are incapable of that kind of infiltration method.

2261
02:13:16,730 --> 02:13:23,910
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We have no mechanisms for drop-offs from the air to have ropes hanging from the helicopter.

2262
02:13:23,910 --> 02:13:31,430
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So the ones we have now are general transport vehicles, but we need our specialized vehicles for police use.

2263
02:13:31,770 --> 02:13:36,950
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And that's another model that I think Senator JB is very familiar with what we can use.

2264
02:13:38,250 --> 02:13:44,570
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And just to give a report sir, I think we had purchased eight helicopters in the past.

2265
02:13:45,190 --> 02:13:53,050
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And we have to restudy the maintenance procedures of the PNP and maybe outsource it.

2266
02:13:53,050 --> 02:13:53,890
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Because in the...

2267
02:13:53,890 --> 02:13:58,390
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In the last four years, three helicopters have crashed already.

2268
02:13:59,270 --> 02:14:07,990
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And so we have to have a restudy on the core competency of the PNP in maintaining and operating helicopters.

2269
02:14:11,520 --> 02:14:15,460
Senator Panfilo Lacson: With indulgence of the Senate President, puntala ko sa unfilled positions.

2270
02:14:16,520 --> 02:14:25,100
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yung total unfilled positions sa DILG, the entire DILG family is 17,000 plus, 17,622.

2271
02:14:25,100 --> 02:14:26,100
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Before we...

2272
02:14:26,640 --> 02:14:30,880
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Go to the breakdown of numbers.

2273
02:14:31,920 --> 02:14:37,300
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ang tanong ko lang po, meron ba kayong recruitment plan, pati yung inyong year-end quota?

2274
02:14:39,690 --> 02:14:44,690
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Say for 2027, kasi most of the unfilled positions, nasa mga uniformed services.

2275
02:14:45,750 --> 02:14:48,550
Senator Panfilo Lacson: PNP, BJMP, BFP.

2276
02:14:49,710 --> 02:14:56,990
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So anong breakdown nito and ano yung inyong year-end quota as per your recruitment plan?

2277
02:14:57,530 --> 02:14:58,130
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir?

2278
02:14:58,150 --> 02:14:59,930
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, ang OSEC, sir.

2279
02:15:00,000 --> 02:15:03,280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, 555 unfilled positions.

2280
02:15:04,180 --> 02:15:08,280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Fill-up rate po namin is 88.87%.

2281
02:15:08,280 --> 02:15:14,880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Naglagay po kami ng mga JO kasi parami hindi qualified sa applicants

2282
02:15:14,880 --> 02:15:20,240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: at hindi tiyatanggap yung sweldo na commensurate sa pinag-aralan nila.

2283
02:15:21,240 --> 02:15:25,620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, we have to have a government optimization program for this

2284
02:15:25,620 --> 02:15:29,680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and rethink the structure that we have.

2285
02:15:30,000 --> 02:15:35,540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The PNP, sir, has 10,041 unfilled positions.

2286
02:15:37,560 --> 02:15:41,440
Senator Panfilo Lacson: And you're requesting for 2,000 to be filled up, diba?

2287
02:15:41,800 --> 02:15:48,160
Senator Panfilo Lacson: For both PNP and BFP, 2,000 for 2027.

2288
02:15:48,380 --> 02:15:50,820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir. Those are for the new recruits, sir. Yes.

2289
02:15:52,040 --> 02:15:55,000
Senator Panfilo Lacson: PNP ganun din, 2,000 for 2027.

2290
02:15:55,320 --> 02:15:59,360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ang mahirap kasi, sir, is recruitment alone is very difficult.

2291
02:16:00,000 --> 02:16:03,020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It's a process to get qualified people to be policemen.

2292
02:16:03,700 --> 02:16:08,280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Andami yung, I think we have a 70% failure rate sa applicants.

2293
02:16:08,800 --> 02:16:10,940
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Andami nag-a-apply pero hindi talaga pumapas eh.

2294
02:16:11,500 --> 02:16:14,480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, doon ho kami nahihirapan talaga sa how to fill it up.

2295
02:16:15,440 --> 02:16:19,280
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yeah, related to that, ano yung per capita recruitment cost?

2296
02:16:21,580 --> 02:16:23,020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Per capita recruitment cost?

2297
02:16:25,200 --> 02:16:26,080
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I'll give you a minute, sir.

2298
02:16:32,390 --> 02:16:34,350
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: 16,000 per police, sir.

2299
02:16:35,510 --> 02:16:38,350
Senator Panfilo Lacson: And yung salary grade ng PNP?

2300
02:16:38,830 --> 02:16:40,790
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Entry, no? Bagong entry.

2301
02:16:42,210 --> 02:16:44,110
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Nasa mga 31,000, diba?

2302
02:16:44,490 --> 02:16:44,850
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

2303
02:16:44,890 --> 02:16:47,090
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Both BFP and PNP.

2304
02:16:47,410 --> 02:16:47,790
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

2305
02:16:48,110 --> 02:16:49,930
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi yung numbers don't add up, ano.

2306
02:16:50,330 --> 02:16:56,750
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yung sa BFP submission, nangingin silang 2,000 additional fire officer 1.

2307
02:16:58,010 --> 02:17:02,390
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ang hiningi nila is 17,717 million pesos.

2308
02:17:02,390 --> 02:17:08,390
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ang sa inyong presentation, ang binigay ninyo is 697.

2309
02:17:08,830 --> 02:17:19,450
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pag dinivide po natin yun, sa 2,000, lumalabas na sa mga 29,000 plus lang eh, per month.

2310
02:17:20,790 --> 02:17:25,770
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, sino mag-aabono? Kasi 31,000 yung sweldo, yung entry level.

2311
02:17:28,020 --> 02:17:31,660
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Or, meron kayong allowance for yung failure.

2312
02:17:32,520 --> 02:17:33,800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pero hindi, recruitment na ito eh.

2313
02:17:34,320 --> 02:17:35,860
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ang assumption dito is recruited.

2314
02:17:35,860 --> 02:17:39,860
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, if you're recruiting, ang program nyo is to recruit 2,000.

2315
02:17:40,240 --> 02:17:44,840
Senator Panfilo Lacson: 2,000 police officers and 2,000 BFP.

2316
02:17:45,900 --> 02:17:49,160
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Bakit may discrepancy sa total? Parang kulang yata.

2317
02:18:00,490 --> 02:18:02,590
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Anyway, paki-reconcile na lang yung mga numbers?

2318
02:18:02,810 --> 02:18:03,210
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

2319
02:18:04,690 --> 02:18:09,450
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We will, in the next budget revision, we will give the complete answer, sir.

2320
02:18:09,470 --> 02:18:10,090
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Maybe sa plenary na lang?

2321
02:18:10,190 --> 02:18:10,830
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sa plenary, sir.

2322
02:18:11,110 --> 02:18:11,690
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you.

2323
02:18:14,470 --> 02:18:16,410
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

2324
02:18:16,410 --> 02:18:19,810
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Mr. Chairman, just a few more questions.

2325
02:18:21,190 --> 02:18:22,410
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kumusta yung ating pulis?

2326
02:18:23,070 --> 02:18:27,870
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pulis to population ratio, to Secretary and to the Chief PNP.

2327
02:18:28,050 --> 02:18:32,470
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: How are we doing with the ideal?

2328
02:18:33,250 --> 02:18:41,470
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang ideal if under Republic Act 6795 is 500 per one.

2329
02:18:42,590 --> 02:18:46,190
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, kumusta yung ating ratio?

2330
02:18:46,190 --> 02:18:52,190
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And sabi nga ng ating chairman ni Senator Ping, iba rin yung nagiging ratio sa urban.

2331
02:18:53,070 --> 02:18:55,490
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Iba rin yung nagiging ratio sa rural, no?

2332
02:18:55,530 --> 02:18:59,070
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But I think system-wide, ano po ang ating ratio ngayon?

2333
02:19:01,330 --> 02:19:06,610
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Your Honor, Mr. Chair, the ideal ratio is 1 is to 5,000.

2334
02:19:07,670 --> 02:19:09,570
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: 1 is to 500.

2335
02:19:10,290 --> 02:19:15,190
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Right now, it is pegged at 1 is to 692.

2336
02:19:15,190 --> 02:19:23,190
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: So, if we will have to compute it, we need...

2337
02:19:24,610 --> 02:19:28,550
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: We need a total of...

2338
02:19:28,550 --> 02:19:42,770
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: How many do we need to reach the 1 is to 500 ratio?

2339
02:19:43,230 --> 02:19:43,450
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes.

2340
02:19:46,990 --> 02:19:56,910
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Right now, we are 130,000 and the ideal is we should be at 271,000, Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

2341
02:19:57,770 --> 02:19:58,870
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: 271,000.

2342
02:19:58,930 --> 02:20:02,670
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, we need 49,000 additional policemen.

2343
02:20:03,350 --> 02:20:11,710
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Mr. President, realistically, ito yung the entire police population, di ba?

2344
02:20:12,990 --> 02:20:19,790
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pero if we consider yung deployed, yung front line against those staying in the headquarters,

2345
02:20:20,510 --> 02:20:21,890
Senator Panfilo Lacson: hindi 1 is to 650 yan.

2346
02:20:22,150 --> 02:20:23,250
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ay, mas mali ito, sir.

2347
02:20:24,190 --> 02:20:25,230
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Mas lalaki pa yung...

2348
02:20:25,230 --> 02:20:27,050
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Lalaki pa pala yung ratio.

2349
02:20:27,050 --> 02:20:30,550
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Assuming na 15% ang nasa headquarters,

2350
02:20:30,850 --> 02:20:32,990
Senator Panfilo Lacson: 85% yung nasa labas.

2351
02:20:33,290 --> 02:20:34,730
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So ano na yung ratio?

2352
02:20:36,310 --> 02:20:41,570
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We would have to study that, sir, kasi ang nangyayari, sir, in any municipality,

2353
02:20:42,550 --> 02:20:48,910
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: a number of them become security personnel of governors, mayors,

2354
02:20:49,510 --> 02:20:54,210
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: even counselors and baragay captains request police.

2355
02:20:54,550 --> 02:20:55,030
Senator Panfilo Lacson: And senators?

2356
02:20:55,910 --> 02:21:00,310
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: There are only 24 senators, sir, so it's not that big a problem.

2357
02:21:00,310 --> 02:21:09,830
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The bigger problem is that there are 82 provinces and there are 169 cities and so many municipalities

2358
02:21:09,830 --> 02:21:14,130
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and they are dispersed as bodyguards of a lot of these politicians, sir.

2359
02:21:15,190 --> 02:21:21,370
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Again, with the permission of the Senate President, alam ni Chief Tating ito, no?

2360
02:21:21,830 --> 02:21:23,370
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Di ba dati tayo 1585?

2361
02:21:24,270 --> 02:21:27,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Mga pa logistics, mga pa finance, mga pa personnel.

2362
02:21:28,830 --> 02:21:29,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hanggang ngayon ba 1585?

2363
02:21:30,310 --> 02:21:38,090
Senator Panfilo Lacson: At all levels, lahat ng headquarters level, nasa 15% lang yung nasa headquarters.

2364
02:21:38,390 --> 02:21:41,730
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Against deployed, yung actually deployed sa field?

2365
02:21:43,770 --> 02:21:47,530
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Yes, Your Honor. That's the policy as of now for the deployment.

2366
02:21:47,830 --> 02:22:00,290
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And we even stretch it as to 90-10, 90%-10% deployment na nasa headquarters and actually on the street.

2367
02:22:00,310 --> 02:22:01,690
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Yes, Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

2368
02:22:02,390 --> 02:22:05,190
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And with regards to the actual number that we needed,

2369
02:22:05,890 --> 02:22:10,310
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: with the number of personnel yearly,

2370
02:22:10,970 --> 02:22:21,730
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: approximately, we are filling up the Philippine National Police by recruiting about 2,000 PNP personnel.

2371
02:22:22,130 --> 02:22:28,230
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And hindi lang naman yun ang kailangan natin if we will stop from recruiting personnel.

2372
02:22:28,230 --> 02:22:29,230
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Kaya nga meron tayong...

2373
02:22:30,310 --> 02:22:34,170
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: To equip them, such that this will be the force multipliers.

2374
02:22:34,850 --> 02:22:45,130
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Like if we have 100 personnel in a police station, mas maganda rin na meron tayong equipage.

2375
02:22:45,350 --> 02:22:53,830
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Like the needed radio, the needed mobility, the needed CCTVs on the street, and others.

2376
02:22:53,830 --> 02:22:59,830
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Such that this 100 personnel on a police station or a...

2377
02:23:00,310 --> 02:23:05,630
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Kaya munisipality, magdo-double or triple ito, Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

2378
02:23:06,430 --> 02:23:14,690
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kung i-juxtapose natin ito sa atrisyon, yung 2,000 mo against yung nagre-retire na mamatay on a yearly basis,

2379
02:23:16,390 --> 02:23:17,950
Senator Panfilo Lacson: ano maging effective number?

2380
02:23:20,450 --> 02:23:23,570
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: About 50% of that, Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

2381
02:23:24,150 --> 02:23:29,570
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Mag-recruit ka ng 2,000, pero actually 1,000 lang yung warm bodies mo doon.

2382
02:23:30,310 --> 02:23:33,330
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: That's correct, Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

2383
02:23:33,450 --> 02:23:34,570
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you. Thank you, Mr. President.

2384
02:23:35,470 --> 02:23:39,590
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Mr. Chair, to answer your question regarding the BFP discrepancies that you saw.

2385
02:23:40,290 --> 02:23:46,390
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The 2,000 additional fire officer, one salary is 717,179,000.

2386
02:23:46,650 --> 02:23:52,410
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But there will be a discrepancy because they will enter the service sometime March, April, or May.

2387
02:23:53,210 --> 02:23:57,130
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, in the end, mas maliit ang magiging siyoldo ng lalabas na siyoldo.

2388
02:23:57,130 --> 02:23:58,150
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hindi 12 months.

2389
02:23:58,150 --> 02:23:59,190
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hindi pa 12 months.

2390
02:23:59,190 --> 02:24:00,090
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you. Now I understand.

2391
02:24:00,310 --> 02:24:00,790
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Okay, sir.

2392
02:24:02,050 --> 02:24:04,050
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sir Chair, singit na ako, no?

2393
02:24:04,490 --> 02:24:08,130
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung sinabi ni Secretary Mulya, I attest to that, no?

2394
02:24:08,230 --> 02:24:13,250
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Marami talaga nagsiserve as security to local government officials.

2395
02:24:14,070 --> 02:24:17,390
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya yung sinabi ni Senator Lacson na 85-15.

2396
02:24:17,970 --> 02:24:22,510
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maganda sana kung ganun na 85 nasa field and then 15 lang nasa office.

2397
02:24:22,650 --> 02:24:23,310
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya ano nangyayari?

2398
02:24:24,370 --> 02:24:29,310
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa aming nga sa San Juan, parang 85 nasa field, yung 15 nasa mayor.

2399
02:24:30,310 --> 02:24:30,630
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Diba?

2400
02:24:31,130 --> 02:24:33,770
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pati anak, lahat ng anak, asawa, lahat.

2401
02:24:34,430 --> 02:24:35,470
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At sa siya, ang dami niya.

2402
02:24:36,130 --> 02:24:43,910
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, dapat bumalik tayo siguro, if you could be strict about it, I think, PSPG, dapat one or two lang allowed, no?

2403
02:24:45,050 --> 02:24:45,690
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung point.

2404
02:24:46,050 --> 02:24:48,130
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And it happens all over the country, you know?

2405
02:24:49,030 --> 02:24:51,690
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito may escort-escort pa, di ba? Lapit-lapit.

2406
02:24:51,690 --> 02:24:52,950
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, sayang.

2407
02:24:53,110 --> 02:25:00,230
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because I think that as local officials, hayaan natin that the police, we need more foot soldiers.

2408
02:25:00,310 --> 02:25:02,030
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: On the ground, di ba?

2409
02:25:02,170 --> 02:25:05,150
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Na hindi nandun lang nagbabantay sa kanila.

2410
02:25:05,410 --> 02:25:06,250
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, totoo po yan.

2411
02:25:06,330 --> 02:25:07,230
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I attest to that.

2412
02:25:08,070 --> 02:25:10,390
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That it really happens, especially the provinces.

2413
02:25:14,160 --> 02:25:15,800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Buti, wala na nga tayong Pogo.

2414
02:25:15,940 --> 02:25:16,840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Dati may Pogo pa.

2415
02:25:17,640 --> 02:25:19,320
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: May pa-isang naging problema.

2416
02:25:20,080 --> 02:25:21,660
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Nagiging bodyguard ng Pogo.

2417
02:25:22,880 --> 02:25:27,120
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Narinig ko, Secretary, that we need to recruit, to bring it down to 500.

2418
02:25:27,960 --> 02:25:28,960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: One is to 500.

2419
02:25:29,160 --> 02:25:31,200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We need to recruit 49,000.

2420
02:25:31,200 --> 02:25:32,160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes, sir.

2421
02:25:32,520 --> 02:25:35,800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But tinitignan ko yung unfilled position ng PNP.

2422
02:25:36,560 --> 02:25:41,860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang base dito sa amin, ang unfilled position is only 9,000.

2423
02:25:42,500 --> 02:25:45,520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, in other words, funded, 9,000.

2424
02:25:45,780 --> 02:25:48,500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But we actually need 49,000.

