Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, that's why we transferred it to the DALG para ma-push yung mga LGUs to take ECCD seriously.

2595
02:35:57,590 --> 02:36:03,770
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And we thank the department for issuing the IRR last August 5.

2596
02:36:03,950 --> 02:36:12,130
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But on the ground, Secretary, and I'm just putting this on the table, just to flag the department,

2597
02:36:12,790 --> 02:36:21,610
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na hindi pa lahat ng LGUs ay nabibigyan ng instructions, maybe through a memorandum circular or a DALG circular,

2598
02:36:22,250 --> 02:36:24,410
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to operationalize the law on the ground.

2599
02:36:24,590 --> 02:36:26,530
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I'll give you a case in point.

2600
02:36:27,010 --> 02:36:32,390
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Under the law, kasi he has to create a separate office for early childhood care.

2601
02:36:32,390 --> 02:36:33,390
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, hindi pa yung nakakreate.

2602
02:36:33,950 --> 02:36:42,330
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Of course, yung mga plantelia items rin, for child development workers, child development teachers, hindi pa rin nakakreate.

2603
02:36:42,470 --> 02:36:44,810
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, I just want to flag the department.

2604
02:36:45,590 --> 02:36:50,450
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Nandiyan na yung IRR, but to mobilize the LGUs, yun na lang ang nagkukulang.

2605
02:36:50,510 --> 02:36:50,830
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

2606
02:36:51,530 --> 02:36:52,210
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Noted, sir.

2607
02:36:52,330 --> 02:36:55,170
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And we will exert all efforts to complete it, sir.

2608
02:36:56,910 --> 02:37:02,470
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Next year, I noted also that the target is quite ambitious.

2609
02:37:02,470 --> 02:37:02,710
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes.

2610
02:37:03,950 --> 02:37:07,210
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Right now, ang ating participation rate na sa 33%.

2611
02:37:07,210 --> 02:37:09,730
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: For 2027, it's 40%.

2612
02:37:09,730 --> 02:37:11,730
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, I support that, of course.

2613
02:37:11,890 --> 02:37:16,150
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: The more mga bata, 3-4 year olds pumapasok, the better.

2614
02:37:16,970 --> 02:37:19,510
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's why it's about time to mobilize the LGUs.

2615
02:37:19,610 --> 02:37:24,950
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And I think, being a former governor, alin yun naman kung paano mag-mobilize ng mga LGUs.

2616
02:37:25,410 --> 02:37:25,850
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yeah.

2617
02:37:26,910 --> 02:37:31,670
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: A large part of that is the feeding program that you will have for the children.

2618
02:37:32,830 --> 02:37:33,830
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We have determined that...

2619
02:37:33,950 --> 02:37:38,490
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We will get a meals ready to eat.

2620
02:37:39,210 --> 02:37:45,370
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Parang yung nutriban dati nung time ng Amerikano at time ng matandang Marcos.

2621
02:37:45,810 --> 02:37:51,190
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But the meals will be pre-packed and just heated in the respective barangays.

2622
02:37:51,650 --> 02:37:56,010
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We find that a more efficient system than giving the money to the LGUs to cook for the children.

2623
02:37:56,310 --> 02:38:00,670
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Because the variance of cost in the mountains and in the cities are different.

2624
02:38:00,670 --> 02:38:03,670
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: However, we contract the...

2625
02:38:03,950 --> 02:38:08,490
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: This company to make meals ready to eat packets that just need to be heated.

2626
02:38:08,890 --> 02:38:19,650
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Then the nutritional value will be more efficiently distributed to the children at a lower cost than to cook it manually over the 42,000 marangays in the country.

2627
02:38:20,490 --> 02:38:22,810
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It's also part of the ECCD law.

2628
02:38:22,810 --> 02:38:33,490
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, ang kulang lang, Secretary, is a memorandum circular to all the LGUs on implementing the law and also operationalizing the law on the ground.

2629
02:38:33,950 --> 02:38:39,090
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think makikita natin malaking pagbabago na sa delivery ng early childhood education.

2630
02:38:39,530 --> 02:38:41,950
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I agree, sir. We will have an MCA regarding this.

2631
02:38:42,090 --> 02:38:42,710
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you. Thank you.

2632
02:38:42,750 --> 02:38:49,450
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And lastly, Mr. Chairman, medyo nagugulat lang ako dun sa mga naririnig ko about BFP.

2633
02:38:50,650 --> 02:38:56,070
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Dati, ang naririnig lang natin, nagbebenta ng fire extinguisher.

2634
02:38:56,270 --> 02:38:58,390
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ngayon, pati yung slots binibenta.

2635
02:38:58,570 --> 02:39:02,070
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kanina, nabanggit nyo yung bid rigging.

2636
02:39:03,190 --> 02:39:03,790
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: No, mayroon pang...

2637
02:39:03,790 --> 02:39:04,490
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Mayroon pang SOP.

2638
02:39:05,070 --> 02:39:07,110
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And I'm very concerned with that.

2639
02:39:07,310 --> 02:39:15,590
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And that's why when you shaked up the BFP, the department, talagang kailangan na talaga.

2640
02:39:15,730 --> 02:39:16,550
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It's about time.

2641
02:39:16,550 --> 02:39:21,370
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And I can see that we have a new chief, a new leader.

2642
02:39:22,890 --> 02:39:24,950
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Nakatrabaho ko po si fire chief sa...

2643
02:39:24,950 --> 02:39:28,830
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Not me, but si Secretary Rex when he was a mayor.

2644
02:39:29,310 --> 02:39:33,550
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, nakita ko na he was a very effective fire chief when he was in Valenzuela.

2645
02:39:33,790 --> 02:39:41,710
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, I hope, Fire Chief Kwan Tiu, matigil na itong mga corrupt practices in the department.

2646
02:39:41,870 --> 02:39:50,730
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Nakakagulat eh, nung I heard earlier, na all the way to bid rigging and slot selling, hindi na maganda.

2647
02:39:51,630 --> 02:39:58,790
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, I hope that massive reforms will be undertaken in order to clean up the BFP.

2648
02:39:59,030 --> 02:39:59,810
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It's begun, sir.

2649
02:39:59,810 --> 02:40:03,210
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, we already had a purge of the top leadership.

2650
02:40:03,790 --> 02:40:05,410
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Those involved in the corruption.

2651
02:40:06,130 --> 02:40:12,590
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And just this morning, I met with all the fire marshals of NCR and Region 4 where our major economic hubs are.

2652
02:40:12,590 --> 02:40:21,490
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And I warned them in no uncertain terms that if I catch them or if they are involved in any shenanigans,

2653
02:40:21,750 --> 02:40:24,470
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I will not hesitate to file charges against them.

2654
02:40:24,990 --> 02:40:30,790
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I told them, I am not part of the system, I have never been part of the system, and I will destroy the system.

2655
02:40:31,370 --> 02:40:33,590
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, it is a very stern warning I gave to the...

2656
02:40:33,790 --> 02:40:34,670
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you, Fire Marshals, today.

2657
02:40:34,850 --> 02:40:37,190
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And we will follow up and make sure that they comply.

2658
02:40:38,090 --> 02:40:38,530
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you, Secretary.

2659
02:40:38,730 --> 02:40:39,450
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

2660
02:40:39,910 --> 02:40:40,270
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you.

2661
02:40:40,970 --> 02:40:46,430
Senator Panfilo Lacson: One of my advocacies, pagka-budget ng pigusapan, and this is one of your mandates,

2662
02:40:46,610 --> 02:40:51,990
Senator Panfilo Lacson: is to ensure the alignment of LGU plans with the national priorities.

2663
02:40:52,750 --> 02:40:53,990
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi ang...

2664
02:40:55,350 --> 02:40:59,970
Senator Panfilo Lacson: In fact, may budget po ito eh, 206 million pesos sa 2027.

2665
02:41:00,610 --> 02:41:03,490
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yun yung support for local governance program.

2666
02:41:03,790 --> 02:41:11,850
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi yung pre-mandanas, ang share ng local government, yung RDC-endorsed PAPs,

2667
02:41:12,330 --> 02:41:13,570
Senator Panfilo Lacson: nasa mga 20% lang.

2668
02:41:14,230 --> 02:41:19,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ito lagi kong pinapoint out every time meron kaming plenary deliberation, especially sa DBCC.

2669
02:41:20,590 --> 02:41:21,190
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Bakit yanon?

2670
02:41:21,870 --> 02:41:27,570
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ang core dapat ng budgeting system natin, sa labas eh, di ba?

2671
02:41:28,570 --> 02:41:29,570
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pero 20%.

2672
02:41:29,570 --> 02:41:33,210
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Now it has improved to something like 35%, pero kulang pa rin.

2673
02:41:33,790 --> 02:41:43,730
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi yung first, yung synchronization ng preparation of the local government plans,

2674
02:41:43,830 --> 02:41:49,730
Senator Panfilo Lacson: ng mga local government councils, hindi ito in sync with the budget call, yung timing.

2675
02:41:50,670 --> 02:41:55,750
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Nagbabudget call tayo, yung start ng process siguro mga January, February.

2676
02:41:56,690 --> 02:42:02,990
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pero halos October na, hindi pa tapos yung deliberation sa mga local development councils.

2677
02:42:02,990 --> 02:42:03,270
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So,

2678
02:42:03,790 --> 02:42:06,770
Senator Panfilo Lacson: how do we, at least, you know,

2679
02:42:07,610 --> 02:42:10,270
Senator Panfilo Lacson: i-synchronize yung timing man lang

2680
02:42:10,270 --> 02:42:15,990
Senator Panfilo Lacson: para tumaas yung percentage ng RDC-endorsed PAPs

2681
02:42:15,990 --> 02:42:19,110
Senator Panfilo Lacson: doon sa pag-craft ng national budget?

2682
02:42:22,050 --> 02:42:26,710
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, the RDC, for the longest time, kasi hindi na pinapansin yung RDC eh.

2683
02:42:27,410 --> 02:42:28,010
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Hindi na talaga.

2684
02:42:28,670 --> 02:42:31,550
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It is only under the administration of the current president

2685
02:42:31,550 --> 02:42:34,050
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that the RDCs have been given more attention to

2686
02:42:34,050 --> 02:42:35,690
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and recommendatory.

2687
02:42:35,870 --> 02:42:37,630
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The biggest hindrance to that, sir,

2688
02:42:37,770 --> 02:42:41,090
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: is that it becomes a political question in its implementation.

2689
02:42:42,910 --> 02:42:46,150
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: When we, when the RDCs, the local development,

2690
02:42:46,390 --> 02:42:48,830
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: when the regional development councils endorse a project,

2691
02:42:49,610 --> 02:42:52,370
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: it becomes a political question on the legislature

2692
02:42:52,370 --> 02:42:56,590
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: whether or not they will put money into the project that has been endorsed.

2693
02:42:58,530 --> 02:42:59,870
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Most of the time, sir,

2694
02:43:01,530 --> 02:43:04,750
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: even upon the insistence of the DILG,

2695
02:43:05,330 --> 02:43:05,830
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that they,

2696
02:43:05,870 --> 02:43:08,430
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: they follow it in the legislature,

2697
02:43:08,690 --> 02:43:10,490
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: somehow in the budget processing system,

2698
02:43:10,670 --> 02:43:12,370
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: nawawala po yung priorities na yan.

2699
02:43:12,930 --> 02:43:18,270
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, if only the congressmen can be part of the RDCs,

2700
02:43:18,270 --> 02:43:22,510
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: so they will realize how important it is that these projects be done,

2701
02:43:22,650 --> 02:43:25,730
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: then maybe they will be in sync with how it is accomplished.

2702
02:43:26,530 --> 02:43:27,270
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Because as of now, sir,

2703
02:43:27,330 --> 02:43:30,390
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the congressmen are not part of the RDCs,

2704
02:43:30,510 --> 02:43:31,310
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and they should be,

2705
02:43:31,650 --> 02:43:32,810
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and senators should be part of it.

2706
02:43:32,810 --> 02:43:35,430
Senator Panfilo Lacson: But they are part of the municipal, provincial,

2707
02:43:35,870 --> 02:43:37,190
Senator Panfilo Lacson: and development councils.

2708
02:43:37,510 --> 02:43:38,470
Senator Panfilo Lacson: They can participate

2709
02:43:38,470 --> 02:43:42,310
Senator Panfilo Lacson: during the deliberation of the local government plans.

2710
02:43:42,450 --> 02:43:42,750
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

2711
02:43:42,770 --> 02:43:43,390
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Members na eh.

2712
02:43:43,810 --> 02:43:45,370
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Even sa barangay level,

2713
02:43:45,850 --> 02:43:47,630
Senator Panfilo Lacson: they can send their own representatives, di ba?

2714
02:43:47,690 --> 02:43:48,330
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yes, yes, sir.

2715
02:43:48,590 --> 02:43:48,910
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Mayor,

2716
02:43:50,090 --> 02:43:51,670
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Mabilog, yes.

2717
02:43:51,890 --> 02:43:52,770
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yeah, Mabilog, Jed.

2718
02:43:53,190 --> 02:43:53,490
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yes.

2719
02:43:53,830 --> 02:43:55,050
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, hindi na pa-practice.

2720
02:43:55,150 --> 02:43:55,330
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Why?

2721
02:43:55,430 --> 02:43:58,490
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Because ang mindset ng congressmen,

2722
02:43:58,490 --> 02:44:00,790
Senator Panfilo Lacson: ba't kami makipag-debate sa inyo dyan?

2723
02:44:00,850 --> 02:44:01,430
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Exactly, sir.

2724
02:44:01,450 --> 02:44:02,930
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Eh, pagdating sa amin, kami yung hari.

2725
02:44:03,230 --> 02:44:03,710
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

2726
02:44:04,050 --> 02:44:04,490
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pumilak.

2727
02:44:04,790 --> 02:44:05,850
Senator Panfilo Lacson: And that's the reason why,

2728
02:44:05,870 --> 02:44:07,750
Senator Panfilo Lacson: pagka-budget season,

2729
02:44:08,330 --> 02:44:10,070
Senator Panfilo Lacson: laging puno yung hallway namin dito.

2730
02:44:10,190 --> 02:44:11,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Puno yung hallway sa batasan.

2731
02:44:13,470 --> 02:44:15,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: May mga folders lahat yung mga local government executives.

2732
02:44:16,950 --> 02:44:17,670
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Namamalimos.

2733
02:44:18,250 --> 02:44:18,730
Senator Panfilo Lacson: That's right, sir.

2734
02:44:18,730 --> 02:44:19,330
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Well, in fact, dapat,

2735
02:44:20,290 --> 02:44:22,810
Senator Panfilo Lacson: kung tataasan natin yung percentage share

2736
02:44:22,810 --> 02:44:24,850
Senator Panfilo Lacson: ng endorsed ng RDC

2737
02:44:24,850 --> 02:44:26,750
Senator Panfilo Lacson: from the local government councils,

2738
02:44:27,470 --> 02:44:28,230
Senator Panfilo Lacson: mawawala na yun eh.

2739
02:44:28,310 --> 02:44:30,970
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi kung i-adapt sa national budget yung kanilang...

2740
02:44:30,970 --> 02:44:31,730
Senator Panfilo Lacson: But, you know,

2741
02:44:32,070 --> 02:44:33,570
Senator Panfilo Lacson: ang aking argument dito is,

2742
02:44:33,570 --> 02:44:34,570
Senator Panfilo Lacson: who would know better

2743
02:44:35,870 --> 02:44:37,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: the needs and priorities

2744
02:44:37,870 --> 02:44:40,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: of the local government units,

2745
02:44:40,870 --> 02:44:42,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: di ba yung local government officials?

2746
02:44:42,870 --> 02:44:44,870
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I totally agree, sir.

2747
02:44:44,870 --> 02:44:46,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pagdating sa crafting ng budget,

2748
02:44:46,870 --> 02:44:47,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: ang laki ng disconnect, no?

2749
02:44:47,870 --> 02:44:48,370
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yes, sir.

2750
02:44:48,370 --> 02:44:49,370
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Bigaw na eh.

2751
02:44:49,370 --> 02:44:50,370
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

2752
02:44:50,370 --> 02:44:53,370
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hindi alam naman ng senators and congressmen

2753
02:44:53,370 --> 02:44:54,370
Senator Panfilo Lacson: yung needs and priorities.

2754
02:44:54,370 --> 02:44:55,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Anong nangyayari pa?

2755
02:44:55,870 --> 02:44:56,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: They don't even,

2756
02:44:56,870 --> 02:44:57,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: when they make,

2757
02:44:57,870 --> 02:44:58,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: or we,

2758
02:44:58,870 --> 02:44:59,870
Senator Panfilo Lacson: when we make insertion,

2759
02:45:00,000 --> 02:45:11,280
Senator Panfilo Lacson: We don't even coordinate or consult with the local government officials and the agencies that will implement the PAPs.

2760
02:45:11,360 --> 02:45:11,880
Senator Panfilo Lacson: You know, problema.

2761
02:45:12,100 --> 02:45:14,440
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So I think it's about time.

2762
02:45:14,820 --> 02:45:20,980
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi, you know, I'm happy na during the campaign, the President issued EO82, diba?

2763
02:45:21,260 --> 02:45:25,120
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ito yung enhancing the Regional Development Council.

2764
02:45:25,120 --> 02:45:32,760
Senator Panfilo Lacson: In fact, when he was joining our campaign, laging meron siyang extra activity with the RDC.

2765
02:45:33,080 --> 02:45:37,240
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Laging kasama sa ano yan, sa kanyang itinerary.

2766
02:45:37,800 --> 02:45:42,340
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kaya misa nadidelay yung rally because nanggagaling pa siya sa RDC meetings.

2767
02:45:43,100 --> 02:45:46,880
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, but how can we translate that into actual practice?

2768
02:45:49,110 --> 02:45:51,570
Senator Panfilo Lacson: How can you fight batasan and how can you fight?

2769
02:45:52,950 --> 02:45:54,190
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, I think...

2770
02:45:54,190 --> 02:45:55,330
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: No, this is the Senate building.

2771
02:45:56,430 --> 02:46:04,230
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, I think the new policy of enhancing the local government support fund has helped a great deal

2772
02:46:04,230 --> 02:46:08,390
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: with the equalization of opportunities for the local government units.

2773
02:46:11,150 --> 02:46:15,450
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Under the auspices of the current President, he's increased it tenfold, I think,

2774
02:46:15,450 --> 02:46:19,870
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and to 58 billion, sir, from...

2775
02:46:19,870 --> 02:46:23,130
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It was less than 6 billion in the previous budget.

2776
02:46:23,730 --> 02:46:24,810
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And it's helped a great deal.

2777
02:46:24,950 --> 02:46:26,390
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And I go around...

2778
02:46:26,430 --> 02:46:33,350
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Local government units and they find great comfort that finally Malacanang is listening to the plight of the local government units.

2779
02:46:33,350 --> 02:46:42,250
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, I think enhancing the LGSF is one of the great equalizing factors in order for these projects and to be aligned with the national project, sir.

2780
02:46:43,050 --> 02:46:44,170
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Some numbers here, no?

2781
02:46:44,950 --> 02:46:49,490
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yung 2025, 22.9 billion LGSF.

2782
02:46:50,530 --> 02:46:55,350
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Nag-spike ito dramatically sa 57.87 billion in 2026.

2783
02:46:56,430 --> 02:46:59,810
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sa 2027 NEP, 58.53 billion.

2784
02:47:00,150 --> 02:47:04,750
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, tumataas talaga yung local government support fund.

2785
02:47:06,350 --> 02:47:09,690
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, just as a clarification.

2786
02:47:09,690 --> 02:47:20,630
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In 2025, sir, the 22.99 billion LGSF was not given to the local governments, but rather disbursed by congressmen and senators.

2787
02:47:21,690 --> 02:47:26,410
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Unlike today, sir, the 58 billion goes directly to the local government.

2788
02:47:26,430 --> 02:47:31,770
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, there is now a greater connection between the local government units and the national governments.

2789
02:47:34,320 --> 02:47:37,000
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Tanong ko lang, did you wrestle with the congressmen when you...

2790
02:47:39,200 --> 02:47:40,720
Senator Panfilo Lacson: During your budget deliberation?

2791
02:47:41,440 --> 02:47:43,560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: No, sir, it was not an issue anymore.

2792
02:47:44,680 --> 02:47:45,740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It was not an issue.

2793
02:47:46,380 --> 02:47:50,260
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We finished last week, two weeks ago, and it was not an issue with them.

2794
02:47:51,020 --> 02:47:52,820
Senator Panfilo Lacson: I'm glad to hear that, Mr. Secretary.

2795
02:47:56,400 --> 02:47:57,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, Mr. Chair.

2796
02:47:57,880 --> 02:47:59,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With regards to...

2797
02:47:59,260 --> 02:48:05,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The reason why this budget hearings, it was started by our Senate President last year,

2798
02:48:05,880 --> 02:48:13,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to prevent occurrence again of anomalous projects like the ghost projects and flood control,

2799
02:48:14,240 --> 02:48:18,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we already require RDC approval, or at the very least provincial,

2800
02:48:18,920 --> 02:48:22,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pero more of the RDC approval for all the projects.

2801
02:48:22,800 --> 02:48:27,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi nangyayari, we do not want a repeat of what happened before

2802
02:48:29,340 --> 02:48:31,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na basta maiproject lang kahit hindi kailangan.

2803
02:48:31,340 --> 02:48:36,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi nga alam ng governor, hindi alam ng local government, nagkakaroon ng projects eh.

2804
02:48:36,340 --> 02:48:42,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So with that, we will now require RDC approval, Mr. Chair, kasi yun yung nangyayari noon.

2805
02:48:42,760 --> 02:48:48,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kahit hindi alam ng LGU or provincia, nagkakaproject para alam na natin

2806
02:48:48,200 --> 02:48:50,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pagkapirahan lang, hindi naman talaga kailangan.

2807
02:48:50,380 --> 02:48:59,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So now, RDC approval is as a requirement now for all the projects or yung pang nangihingi ng

2808
02:48:59,400 --> 02:49:01,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: additional and

2809
02:49:01,800 --> 02:49:03,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for national funding.

2810
02:49:03,440 --> 02:49:04,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

2811
02:49:05,880 --> 02:49:06,680
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yes.

2812
02:49:13,340 --> 02:49:15,900
Senator Panfilo Lacson: We are thinking of passing a legislation that the UHC...

2813
02:49:15,900 --> 02:49:19,460
Senator Panfilo Lacson: this is not enough at the local level, for the universal healthcare program.

2814
02:49:19,460 --> 02:49:22,260
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Our chairman is the champion.

2815
02:49:22,260 --> 02:49:25,500
Senator Panfilo Lacson: He is the author of the UHC.

2816
02:49:25,500 --> 02:49:27,500
Senator Panfilo Lacson: He is the one that sponsored it.

2817
02:49:27,500 --> 02:49:28,240
Senator Panfilo Lacson: We are thinking of earmarking.

2818
02:49:28,240 --> 02:49:35,880
Senator Panfilo Lacson: The DOH fund, especially in hospitals, is already earmarked by the LGUs, just like the Calamity Fund, right? It has 5%.

2819
02:49:35,880 --> 02:49:41,020
Senator Panfilo Lacson: How about earmarking, say, 10 or 15%?

2820
02:49:41,760 --> 02:49:54,500
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So that the national government will not know how to deploy the logistics or the support for the health programs of the LGUs.

2821
02:49:54,500 --> 02:50:04,960
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, I think we should take caution to that, because not all local governments have the capacity to implement, to absorb the said amounts.

2822
02:50:05,720 --> 02:50:14,780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: As it is, the setup is that the universal health care plan goes to the government hospitals directly to support the program.

2823
02:50:16,160 --> 02:50:24,480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Giving it directly to the LGUs might be counterproductive, because not all LGUs have the capacity to implement.

2824
02:50:24,500 --> 02:50:37,920
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, thank you, Mr. Secretary, and thank you to the entire...

2825
02:50:39,100 --> 02:50:51,880
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Anyway, support staff, in case the Secretary needs to ask, you will also ask.

2826
02:50:52,240 --> 02:50:58,780
Senator Panfilo Lacson: But it looks like all the Secretaries know the answer, so you are not top yet.

2827
02:50:58,780 --> 02:51:02,780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Mr. Chairman, actually, to be honest...

2828
02:51:02,920 --> 02:51:14,400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: To be honest about it, I'm not saying this because the Secretary is here, but I have a lot of respect for the Secretaries who, when it comes to the budget season, budget hearings, they are the ones who answer.

2829
02:51:14,800 --> 02:51:17,180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It means that they know their budget.

2830
02:51:19,060 --> 02:51:25,000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Because there are many Secretaries, oh, Yusek, answer this, oh, Asek, answer this, oh, this, Director, answer this.

2831
02:51:25,660 --> 02:51:28,760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's your budget, you should know what your budget contains.

2832
02:51:28,760 --> 02:51:32,760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, you should defend your budget, not Yusek, not Asek.

2833
02:51:32,920 --> 02:51:33,820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yusek is not the Director.

2834
02:51:34,440 --> 02:51:38,260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, I'm not saying this because I've been in Central JB, it sounds familiar.

2835
02:51:39,800 --> 02:51:40,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, sir.

2836
02:51:41,480 --> 02:51:45,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Likewise, I'm sorry, sir, bago mag-adjourn, siguro request ko lang kay Usec, no?

2837
02:51:45,900 --> 02:51:56,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'm now the Chair of the local government again, and sometimes we have some measures or bills that are being heard for local governments.

2838
02:51:56,860 --> 02:52:01,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Andami akong nakitang Usec na bago at Asec.

2839
02:52:01,680 --> 02:52:02,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maybe you can say...

2840
02:52:02,920 --> 02:52:06,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maybe you can send someone that will be designated, that can speak for the department.

2841
02:52:07,260 --> 02:52:12,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi lately, napagalitan ko yung huli, director, pinadala ilang beses, hindi naman makasagot.

2842
02:52:13,320 --> 02:52:15,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, I hope it doesn't happen again.

2843
02:52:15,180 --> 02:52:16,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dati si Usec Rolando Puno, di ba?

2844
02:52:17,160 --> 02:52:18,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya nag-a-attend, nung Asec pa kayo.

2845
02:52:18,980 --> 02:52:20,660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nag-Usec ka, hindi na kita nakita.

2846
02:52:22,040 --> 02:52:22,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sana naman mag-a-

2847
02:52:22,980 --> 02:52:25,940
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That was a mistake on my part, sir. And we will make sure to rectify.

2848
02:52:25,940 --> 02:52:31,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro for legislative, ano lang, concerns, you may be send someone.

2849
02:52:31,300 --> 02:52:32,680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

2850
02:52:32,920 --> 02:52:35,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At sila, yung Usec Marlo Iringan, yung mga usual natin noon eh.

2851
02:52:35,920 --> 02:52:41,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya yun ang naging [unclear]. Baka naman na-tempo lang itong dalawang director. Hindi makasagot eh, so sayang lang.

2852
02:52:41,920 --> 02:52:48,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, we send someone that will be designated for our legislative functions.

2853
02:52:48,360 --> 02:52:48,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, sir.

2854
02:52:49,000 --> 02:52:49,700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you very much, sir.

2855
02:52:49,880 --> 02:52:52,980
Senator Panfilo Lacson: In the same vein, I'm now the Chairman of the Public Order Committee.

2856
02:52:53,880 --> 02:52:59,340
Senator Panfilo Lacson: The Firearms Amendment, about the Firearms, I will attend to that.

2857
02:52:59,340 --> 02:53:02,680
Senator Panfilo Lacson: I just need your draft of your legislative proposal.

2858
02:53:02,920 --> 02:53:03,920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you very much, sir.

2859
02:53:03,920 --> 02:53:10,920
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, with that, is there a motion to approve and submit to the plenary the budget of the DILG?

2860
02:53:10,920 --> 02:53:18,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, Mr. Chair, I move that the budget of the DILG and its attached agencies be submitted

2861
02:53:18,380 --> 02:53:25,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to the plenary for discussion and for debates, further debates, Mr. Chair.

2862
02:53:25,440 --> 02:53:26,440
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, the motion is approved.

2863
02:53:26,440 --> 02:53:27,440
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you very much.

2864
02:53:27,440 --> 02:53:28,440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you very much.

2865
02:53:28,440 --> 02:53:29,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you very much.

